      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——“SETO”。\r\n这是，也许能将新宇宙引导去除了经典三冠之\r\n外的路线的关键词。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11030a64e11e97dc7a88627732bf01fe36a1854f2fc06556b444d468c543f4bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
