      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而其含义不明——但既然其中每个字母都如此明确，\r\n那么也应该可以进行一番彻底的调查。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b76785b06d0ab5d2472abaeccedc0bd110c2934f5e8354c9f2ad41521fca7d2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
