      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若不参加经典三冠便去挑战『天皇赏（春）』，\r\n那么应该采取怎样的路线呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9f2c6a0a5c34c9705ce51179de5cae476418689b799cdf3a65d9bf37fb1685a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
